The start date defaults to today, not to the end date, so the route holds the clock date 2026-10-15 before the end date.
-- args --
devices
solar
3333
--end
2026-10-20
-- route GET /web-gateway/solar/3333/2026-10-15/2026-10-20 --
{"value":1}
